7046</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747046</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 22:00:09 GMT</pubDate><author>柳橙汁</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>早安</title><description>早安&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1743458362382_c4004c96-b2e0-4d2f-8a1f-f3df3bfdb14c.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1743458362382_c4004c96-b2e0-4d2f-8a1f-f3df3bfdb14c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747045</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747045</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 21:59:23 GMT</pubDate><author>kai</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>每一個困境，都深深藏著生活的轉機，</title><description>每一個困境，都深深藏著生活的轉機，&lt;br&gt;熬過去了，一切就都會慢慢變好。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;一念心轉，則心開意解, 福就來，&lt;br&gt;一念清淨，則心誠意正, 運就通。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;一心正向，則心正氣盛, 邪不侵，&lt;br&gt;一心向善，則一念善心, 破千災。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;有些事，害怕也沒用，倒不如勇敢面對，&lt;br&gt;或許還能找到解決的方法，&lt;br&gt;人在低谷時要勇敢點，才有機會擺脫困境。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;無論生活對自己如何，都要勇敢一些，&lt;br&gt;無論順逆皆是人生，只要有勇氣站起來，&lt;br&gt;就有機會重新開始。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;生活嘛，適合自己的就是最好的，&lt;br&gt;不嫉妒、不攀比、不羨慕、不強求，&lt;br&gt;在陽光下微笑，在風雨中奔跑。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;人生，不怕起點低，就怕沒追求&lt;br&gt;不怕走的慢，就怕走錯路，&lt;br&gt;不怕不如意，就怕想不通。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;與其羨慕別人，不如做好自己，&lt;br&gt;渡生活的難，謝時光的暖，&lt;br&gt;讓喜歡的事情成爲生活。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;文圖道法自然分享&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1743458292883_5c192f08-b12d-4e22-97a1-a90c2b5e1919.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1743458292883_5c192f08-b12d-4e22-97a1-a90c2b5e1919.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747044</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747044</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 21:58:13 GMT</pubDate><author>太ったトカゲ</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>4月1日 星期二</title><description>朋友們今日愉快🙋🏻‍♂️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🎈Morning 🎈好運爆棚☘️&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;送上開心😃送上平安💯&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#甘苦郎😆&lt;br&gt;#乖乖上班去🧑‍💻&lt;br&gt;#賺錢卡實在 💵&lt;br&gt;#樓下上班👨‍🍳&lt;br&gt;#下班樓上 💋&lt;br&gt;#230&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1743457801933_d9ace2d7-f2cc-4b31-aeb7-00ff9fe6b75e.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1743457801933_d9ace2d7-f2cc-4b31-aeb7-00ff9fe6b75e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747037</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747037</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 21:50:02 GMT</pubDate><author>꧁ 凌 駕 ꧂</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item><item><title>今日天氣</title><description>降雨趨緩注意低溫&lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://img.bc3ts.net/image/post/tumb/1743457703414_da587295-d88a-445f-9929-bb9b157a809e.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;1743457703414_da587295-d88a-445f-9929-bb9b157a809e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  </description><link>https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747036</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://web.bc3ts.net/post/6747036</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 21:48:24 GMT</pubDate><author>郭紅蘋果</author><category>爆廢公社</category></item></channel></rss>